<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab gunmen ambushed a road construction team on the Arabia-Lafey road in Mandera, Kenya, killing eight people, including two National Police Reservists and five civilian workers. The same group also attacked a security escort vehicle in the same area, resulting in additional fatalities. Somali Danab commandos launched security operations in Middle Shabelle targeting Al-Shabaab extortion networks. US forces carried out overnight airstrikes against ISIS positions in Puntland, Somalia. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQdk1XU216eUFxRzdTN0dUMl9tejJwcEhMMUNaZ0NEUFkybGN4cWQ2blY4VjREakhMVnJhY3hCdUZzdEN3TDV1cENrTmY0Z25TM1NTVHY0Z0VoU2dBV0ZNaGxVUTlsRFRwaTVXM3BFSmhuNnA2LTY0UUV3QVE3V0NOSXZ1TmdXcGYwSkxTSjVaeHY1S21zVW5WU19MOFE5Vmg5dkdUcFZaUXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNV3A0Vm1uM0pCWV9qQUpJb25EZ0x3U2JLREhnZXJYTXdMeUFnd2gxMmhCVGZIZXB6TzZwc2lWbnc4eGtZcDZaZG9sd0dhc0tiY2ZvTl9hcGhYQ29UTG4waWluWnVReXFRU0U5VDBqcnNQX0RmQUJsRGRnQVRfZ2xsTDh6MHRzYmlvRnk2WjlFMDR4Y2VIRTBORy0tOF9zYXFvY0lsWTNYUlRGZk9iYk53dEJKbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPb3RfRlVveVFyNkx0UkRLQktyT3pWNXczbVJPTDVCUVd5MFFMX3hHM0d6cHpLNkJGN09GaXVmWlFQbFhORUJYNXI2UldFOTc1NExYNFEwUDFnUURzQUZiU2VnN2hGVjNjR3hYejdRMnp6RmhXLUVKNGtoOF85UkdsR3J2TV9KUVZjUUlSR3RpYmlWMFo3bVc2Z05aS2lWSWJtd2Z2OWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Horseed Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOaFhJZVBVSkczbnYwQTM3XzNLQ1VUQU9RU0FmNjBuZWg1aWxfdkRzZF9GbjdSTUZFcTZkcERmTTRvcHJOVGtsQm1XVjFKMXU0YUNZcmRtWTBNVVBKNXpzelQ4S2pzWlRKeF9saEl0Ry1uR